# Local-only source bundle; never stage or push it.
/source/

# Preserved nested repository metadata; the parent repository is authoritative.
**/.git-nested-backup/

# Nested worktrees are local working copies, not monorepo content.
**/.worktrees/

# Full source texts stay local for copyright and repository-size reasons.
# 未锚定：任意层级的完整原文底稿一律不得进入 Git 树（含仓库根，2026-09-19 P0 围堵）。
蛊真人.txt
蛊真人-clean.txt
《人祖传》.txt
gu-zhenren-editor/分支：六卷精编版/蛊真人-clean.txt
gu-zhenren-editor/分支：六卷精编版/《人祖传》.txt
game/分支：六卷精编版/蛊真人-clean.txt
game/分支：六卷精编版/《人祖传》.txt

# Local test output, backups, sabotage/debug logs, and generated shortlist files.
/map_test_result.txt
**/*.bak-*
**/gate_sabotage.log
**/generated/_shortlist_spec.txt
gu-zhenren-editor/tools/_*.txt
game/tools/_*.txt

# Common local OS/editor noise.
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Local browser verification caches and captured proof output.
/.playwright-cli/
/output/

# 已退役的旧游戏路径：Task 7 之后磁盘上只剩本地恢复材料与缓存
# （.git-nested-backup/、.worktrees/、.godot/、tmp*/、本地原文），均不进入 Git 树。
/gu-zhenren-editor/

# Python 字节码缓存：本机生成物，不入库（2026-09-23 收口时补围堵）。
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# working/ 是本地工作区（含 full-compress 全本、_vol1_raw 卷原文等原文底稿）。
# 依 AGENTS.md「禁止提交完整原始小说」与 2026-08-24「working 目录转入本地不入库」裁决，
# 整目录保持不入库；需要归档其中某个非原文产物时单独挑出。
/working/
